A '''Catamin''' (ネコビタン, ''Nekobitan'', '''Nekovitan''') is a type of item added in [[Version 5.0 Update|version 5.0]] with several miscellaneous applications and acquisition methods. There are three types of Catamins; from least to most valuable, they are [A], [B] and [C].

==Uses==
*Speeding up a [[Gamatoto Expedition]] or [[Ototo Corps]] project (1 hour for [A], 3 hours for [B], 6 hours for [C])
*Playing [[Catamin Stages]] (cost varies by map)
*Shortening [[Gauntlet]] standby periods by 30 minutes (1 Catamin [A])

==Sources==
*Buying them in sets of 3 using [[Cat Food]] (30 for [A], 80 for [B], 150 for [C])
*[[User Rank]] rewards starting from User Rank 2050
*Doing draws on [[Catamin Capsule]]s or [[Cat Capsule#Lucky Capsule G|Lucky Capsule G]]s.
*Donating 5,000,000 XP to the [[Cat Shrine]] (20% chance for [A] or [B] x1, 17% for [C] x1)
*[[Heavenly Tower]]: Floors [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 6|6]] ([A] x5), [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 8|8]] ([B] x5) and [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 11|11]] ([C] x3)
*[[Infernal Tower]]: Floors [[Infernal Tower/Floor 2|2]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 5|5]] [[Infernal Tower/Floor 8|Floor 8]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 12|12]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 15|15]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 18|18]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 22|22]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 25|25]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 28|28]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 32|32]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 35|35]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 38|38]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 43|43]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 46|46]], [[Infernal Tower/Floor 49|49]] (3 random Catamins of any one type for Floors 2-38, 5 of any one type for Floors 43-49)
*Certain Gauntlet stages
*[[Enigma Stages]]: [[The Precipice (Insane)|Vitamin Valley]] or [[Lake of Lava (Insane)|Vitamin Volcano]]

